# .worktreeinclude: the ignored files copied from your checkout into a new worktree (report 5.4).
# Copy this file to ./.worktreeinclude and commit it. Only these two names are ever copied, whatever else you write here:
# they hold LOCAL development and test values. Production files, keys and credentials never go into a worktree an agent works in
# (the doctor's `secrets.worktreeinclude` check fails on any other line, and loopctl ignores it).
.env.local
.env.test
